{"seq":2,"slug":"distance-and-paths","title":"距离与路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/distance-and-paths","wordCount":1363,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"距离与路径\">距离与路径</h1><p>在网络中，两个看似毫不相干的人往往只隔几步。&quot;路径&quot;&quot;最短路径&quot;&quot;距离&quot;&quot;平均路径长度&quot;这组概念，刻画了节点之间的可达性，并引出 SNA 最著名的实证发现——&quot;小世界&quot;现象与&quot;六度分隔&quot;。本节给出严格定义，复盘米尔格拉姆的原始实验与其数据细节，并解释瓦茨-斯特罗加茨模型为何能调和&quot;高聚类&quot;与&quot;短路径&quot;这对看似矛盾的特性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>刻画节点间可达性的术语，本节先固定如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径</td>\n<td>连接两点的连边序列（节点不重复为简单路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最短路径</td>\n<td>边数最少的路径（geodesic）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(A,B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最短路径的长度；不连通记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直径</td>\n<td>全网最大距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{i,j}d(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均路径长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全网所有节点对距离的平均，衡量整体紧凑度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小世界</td>\n<td>高聚类系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 与短平均路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 并存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路径-最短路径与距离\">路径、最短路径与距离</h2><p>从节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 经过的连边序列称为&quot;路径&quot;（path，节点不重复称简单路径）。其中边数最少者为&quot;最短路径&quot;（shortest path / geodesic），其长度即两节点的&quot;距离&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(A,B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。距离 1 = 直接相邻，距离 2 = &quot;朋友的朋友&quot;，依此类推；不连通的两点距离记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径</td>\n<td>连接两点的边序列</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最短路径</td>\n<td>边数最少的路径</td>\n<td>BFS（无权）/ Dijkstra（加权）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最短路径长度</td>\n<td>全对最短路径 Floyd-Warshall</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离心率</td>\n<td>到最远点的距离</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_j d(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直径</td>\n<td>全网最大离心率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{i,j} d(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最短路径是 SNA 的基础运算：它既定义距离，也是<a href=\"../centrality/betweenness-closeness\">中介与接近中心性</a>的计算基础。无权网络用广度优先搜索（BFS）即可在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N+E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间求出单源最短路径，算法细节见<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/graph-theory/fundamentals/paths-connectivity\">图论·路径与连通性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小世界与六度分隔\">小世界与六度分隔</h2><p>朴素直觉认为，全人类网络中两个陌生人的距离应该很大。但斯坦利·米尔格拉姆（Stanley Milgram）1967 年的&quot;小世界实验&quot;颠覆了这一直觉。实验让美国内布拉斯加州的&quot;起点人&quot;通过私人熟人把一封信转寄给波士顿的一名股票经纪人（目标），每人只能转给一个自认为更接近目标的熟人。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>296 名起点中，最终有 64 条链条成功送达。</li>\n<li>成功链条的平均长度约为 5.2 个中间人（常被概括为&quot;约 6 步&quot;）。</li>\n<li>米尔格拉姆 1967 年在《Psychology Today》发表《The Small World Problem》，1969 年与杰弗里·特拉弗斯（Jeffrey Travers）发表正式数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&quot;六度分隔&quot;一词其实出自约翰·古尔（John Guare）1990 年的同名戏剧，米尔格拉姆本人从未用过。该结论也有争议：朱迪丝·克兰菲尔德（Judith Kleinfeld）2002 年指出完成率仅约 22%，存在严重的&quot;失败链条偏差&quot;。2008 年微软研究者对 1.8 亿 MSN 用户的研究测得平均链长约 6.6，部分支持了原结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[米尔格拉姆 1967] --&gt; B[296 起点人]&#10;  B --&gt; C[64 条链送达]&#10;  C --&gt; D[平均约 5.2 个中间人]&#10;  D --&gt; E[六度分隔: Guare 1990 命名]&#10;  A --&gt; F[争议: 22% 完成率]&#10;  F --&gt; G[MSN 2008: 平均 6.6]\">graph TD\n  A[米尔格拉姆 1967] --&gt; B[296 起点人]\n  B --&gt; C[64 条链送达]\n  C --&gt; D[平均约 5.2 个中间人]\n  D --&gt; E[六度分隔: Guare 1990 命名]\n  A --&gt; F[争议: 22% 完成率]\n  F --&gt; G[MSN 2008: 平均 6.6]</pre><h2 id=\"平均路径长度与瓦茨-斯特罗加茨模型\">平均路径长度与瓦茨-斯特罗加茨模型</h2><p>把全网所有节点对的距离平均，得&quot;平均路径长度&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>，衡量网络整体紧凑度。小世界的精确定义结合了两个量：聚类系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（朋友的朋友也互为朋友的概率）与平均路径长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>1998 年邓肯·瓦茨（Duncan Watts）与史蒂文·斯特罗加茨（Steven Strogatz）在《Nature》发表《Collective dynamics of &#39;small-world&#39; networks》（393 卷 440–442 页），用一个模型解开了悖论：从一个高聚类的规则环格出发，仅随机&quot;重连&quot;极少比例的边，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 就急剧下降到接近随机图水平，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎不变。结论是——只需极少数&quot;长程捷径&quot;（long-range shortcut），庞大且高聚类的网络也能成为小世界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络类型</th>\n<th>聚类系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>平均路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则环格</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瓦茨-斯特罗加茨（少量重连）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>小（小世界）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机图（埃尔德什-雷尼）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些&quot;长程捷径&quot;在社会学里正是格兰诺维特的&quot;弱连带/桥&quot;（见<a href=\"../structure-and-community/weak-ties-and-bridges\">弱连带与桥</a>）；模型一般化见<a href=\"../../../systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/small-world\">网络科学·小世界</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[规则环格: 高C 大ℓ] --&gt; B[随机重连少量边]&#10;  B --&gt; C[捷径出现]&#10;  C --&gt; D[ℓ 骤降]&#10;  C --&gt; E[C 几乎不变]&#10;  D --&gt; F[小世界]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">flowchart LR\n  A[规则环格: 高C 大ℓ] --&gt; B[随机重连少量边]\n  B --&gt; C[捷径出现]\n  C --&gt; D[ℓ 骤降]\n  C --&gt; E[C 几乎不变]\n  D --&gt; F[小世界]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"权衡与反模式\">权衡与反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>反模式：把&quot;六度&quot;当精确常数。</strong> 它依赖网络、采样与完成率；克兰菲尔德 2002 年的批评提醒我们关注失败链条偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式：忽略加权距离。</strong> 强弱关系混合时，按边数算的&quot;距离&quot;可能误导，应区分跳数距离与成本距离。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡：直径 vs 平均路径。</strong> 直径受极端离群点影响大，平均路径更稳健地刻画整体紧凑度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>路径是连边序列，最短路径长度即距离；BFS/Dijkstra 是基础算法，也是中介/接近中心性的计算地基。</li>\n<li>米尔格拉姆 1967 年小世界实验测得成功链平均约 5.2 个中间人，&quot;六度分隔&quot;实为 Guare 1990 年命名；完成率仅约 22% 是其主要争议。</li>\n<li>瓦茨-斯特罗加茨 1998 年模型证明：极少数长程捷径即可让高聚类大网络兼具短平均路径，这正是弱连带的结构作用。</li>\n<li>慎将&quot;六度&quot;当常数、注意加权距离与采样偏差；下一节进入<a href=\"density-and-connectivity\">密度与连通性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"距离与路径","id":"距离与路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"路径、最短路径与距离","id":"路径-最短路径与距离"},{"level":2,"text":"小世界与六度分隔","id":"小世界与六度分隔"},{"level":2,"text":"平均路径长度与瓦茨-斯特罗加茨模型","id":"平均路径长度与瓦茨-斯特罗加茨模型"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡与反模式","id":"权衡与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"节点的度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/degree"},"next":{"title":"密度与连通性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-network-analysis/basic-concepts/density-and-connectivity"}}